<title>FRANCE: SGS-Thomson sees semiconductor mkt growth.</title>
<headline>SGS-Thomson sees semiconductor mkt growth.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semiconductor firm SGS-Thomson chairman Pasquale Pistorio said on Thursday that he expected the world semiconductor market to grow by five to seven percent in 1997.</p>
<p>Pistorio was speaking to a news conference after the company announced its first half results.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
